{"run_id":"run_11570367611c","schema_version":"0.1","seq":11,"t_ms":11,"text":"The 2026 carrier rate card (res://docs/internal/carrier-rates-2026) only describes how pricing works. It doesn't list any lanes or actual rates.\n\n- **Pricing basis:** Rates are quoted per lane and reviewed every quarter.\n- **Fuel surcharges:** These follow the published regional fuel index, one month behind.\n- **Lane codes:** They use the same origin-destination-service format as since 2024.\n\nThe only other search result was the 2026 finance review calendar, which doesn't cover rates. If you need specific lanes and prices, there may be a separate rate table or spreadsheet. I can look for it if you know where it's kept or what it's called.","turn":3,"type":"agent.message"}
